  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Lay Down Sally**: rare: 3 archived performances [10]\n- **Old News Broadcast**: rare: 10 archived performances [10]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **deadco2025-04-19.stelladew** (recommended): source not stated; 19 songs; 164 min; rated 5/5 by 2 [1]\n- **deadco2025-04-19**: source not stated; 19 songs; 165 min; rated 1.8/5 by 5 [2]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Stage talk about: Crowd 1st Set, Crowd 2nd Set [1]\n- A woman near the reviewer talked throughout the whole first set, disturbing the listening experience [9]\n- Reviewer says they attended this show in person [8]\n- A reviewer says Hunter S has a question for the taper Stella Dew and wants to connect them [5]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **deadco2025-04-19.stelladew**: taped by Stella Dew; transferred by Stella Dew; source: Zoom iQ7 > iPhone [1]. Also: Taped with a Zoom iQ7 into an iPhone 11, then converted from WAV through Audacity to FLAC [1]\n- **deadco2025-04-19**: taped by Cam Keough; transferred by Cam Keough; source: Sennheiser MKE 2 -> Naiant Tinyhead-> Pixel 5 (24/48) [2]. Also: Recorded with Sennheiser MKE 2 mics and a Naiant Tinyhead into a Pixel 5 at 24/48; processed via Adobe Audition, CD WAVE, THL [2]",
